      ironpalm: "She filled the web with snares. Three quiet places. Then three more, a step round. We moved together. Those with eggs left them where they had stood.",
      ranger: "Snares on every inch but three holes, then three more a turn round. Took the far hole, then the next. Had the eggs once: waited, dropped it where I stood, moved on.",
